22950.d:
"Everything grows by subdivision" a general observation that led to defining this work and the concept behind it as a study how a surface can be subdivided recursively to define forms. The patterns inside the forms are generated by parametric equations and also change according to the forms that contain them.

@beardcoded 
1st jan 2023

